#: src/FalconOcr.App/Pages/WorkspacePage.cs:1361
msgid ""
"Falcon OCR — offline OCR with PaddleOCR (PP-OCRv5)\n"
"\n"
"1. Add PDFs, images, image sequences, paste or scan a page.\n"
"2. Choose the language and document type on the right.\n"
"3. Recognize (F5). The recognized page is rebuilt next to the original;\n"
"    click a line to find it in the image, double-click (or F2) to correct it.\n"
"4. Export to Word, Excel or HTML (Ctrl+E).\n"
"\n"
"Shortcuts: Ctrl+O add files · Ctrl+V paste image · Ctrl+R rotate · Del remove\n"
"PgUp/PgDn pages · Ctrl+wheel zoom · middle mouse pans"
msgstr ""
"Falcon OCR — 基于 PaddleOCR (PP-OCRv5) 的离线 OCR\n"
"\n"
"1. 添加 PDF、图像、图像序列，粘贴或扫描页面。\n"
"2. 在右侧选择语言和文档类型。\n"
"3. 识别 (F5)。识别结果会在原稿旁重建；\n"
"    单击某一行可在图像中定位，双击（或 F2）可进行更正。\n"
"4. 导出为 Word、Excel 或 HTML (Ctrl+E)。\n"
"\n"
"快捷键：Ctrl+O 添加文件 · Ctrl+V 粘贴图像 · Ctrl+R 旋转 · Del 删除\n"
"PgUp/PgDn 翻页 · Ctrl+滚轮 缩放 · 鼠标中键 平移"

